Project Scope

System
Event Ticket Sales Management System for a Theather Ticket Office.

User Groups
1. Patron (User)
2. Administrator

System Features
1. User registration and login.
2. Browse available theatre events.
3. View event details and schedules.
4. View available ticket categories and prices.
5. Select and book tickets.
6. Purchase tickets and update payment status.
7. View and manage booking history.
8. Receive and download e-tickets.
9. User account management.
10. Event and ticket management (Administrator).
11. Booking and payment monitoring (Administrator).
12. Generate ticket sales reports (Administrator).
